  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "SiteGround is managed WordPress hosting sold as shared-plan packaging (StartUp / GrowBig / GoGeek) — same hosting-providers cluster as WP Engine, Kinsta, and Cloudways, not a Plesk/cPanel panel licence. StartUp advertises $2.99 intro then renews at $17.99/month; GrowBig renews $29.99; GoGeek $44.99. startingPriceMonthly $17.99 is the ongoing StartUp floor — do not use the intro promo as the research floor. WP Engine remains the cluster award (7.7); this entity does not outrank it. Landscape-only versus Plesk.",
